{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Criminal Justice","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eac9ylXW2mazqOI5L50uY9Rvmxr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hfkTZuQAYtrCkwEhV8c4K0xmU2c.jpg","description":"Sex, drugs and a gruesome murder. An edgy one night stand turns into a nightmare for Aditya, when he wakes up with blood on his hands. The evidence is stacked against him, but he doesn't remember the grisly crime. Is he guilty or not ?\n\nEnded · First aired 5 Apr 2019 · India · Language: Hindi · 50 min\nStudio: Applause Entertainment, BBC Studios India · Network: Disney+ Hotstar\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 10/10\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Crime","Mystery","Drama","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Once Upon a Night","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Driving his family's cab for one night, Aditya picks up a young woman, Sanaya, and ends up spending the evening with her. After a night of sex and drugs, he wakes up to find her stabbed to death but has no recollection of what happened.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nGeP8j7jjibr7oA8ftOTRdNs2gL.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.2","title":"Under Arrest","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"By the end of the night, Aditya is in police custody. Madhav, a small-time advocate bargains to represent him, but fails. To his surprise, Mandira, a big fish in the game takes up Aditya's case pro bono.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m3HG7QAmiNQvLmkk7TJO2OYj539.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.3","title":"The Price of Life","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mandira grapples with Aditya's amnesia related to the fateful night, whereas, Madhav finds a new lead in his investigation. Meanwhile, in jail, Mustafa makes an unexpected demand from Aditya.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/71E796ew7ht8wpWXYyCcaTswYbE.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.4","title":"The Trial","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mustafa takes Aditya under his wing and gives him an unusual welcome gift. At the trial, Madhav realises that a mountain of evidence is stacked against Aditya.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bYSZd6w6t8O7d2P6rT7Ug8bL59s.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.5","title":"Beginning of the End","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The tension between Mustafa and Layak heats up. Meanwhile, Aditya weighs the pros and cons of pleading guilty as Jimmy D'Souza makes a shocking revelation in court.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xzMF9KktCSnbZcgHhTVmaWvhTtC.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.6","title":"Judgement Day","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Aditya takes on a daunting task to appease Mustafa, Nikhat risks her career to free him. Will she prove his innocence?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rwrnHTOxWQ1uGTNfduNQ7s6mkIz.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.7","title":"A New Bond","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Aditya’s bond with Mustafa deepens but his family begins to crumble. Meanwhile, Madhav finds a dangerous lead, giving the case a new direction.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kMOyHI6nbJ5gCq9WggsJeUjVJIi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.8","title":"The Going Gets Tough","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With the entry of a new rival, Aditya and Mustafa end up in solitary confinement. Meanwhile, Madhav and Nikhat find a previously unnoticed clue.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dO6iG8TcXVqQ4puW68iBIo4gaQ3.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.9","title":"A New Kingpin","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A brutal fight sends Aditya to the hospital, where he meets Mustafa. Raghu helps Madhav and Nikhat, and together they open a new can of worms.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hB8reUXbVGr12qbOqstE0F8CEgO.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ3JpbWluYWwlMjBKdXN0aWNlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8.1.10","title":"The Mystery","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Aditya peddles drugs in jail, but that doesn't go well with Layak. Raghu produces a search warrant against the new suspect. Pushed into a corner, Aditya plans his final revenge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o9KZv0PLUDkJXdfTuzko8KmCMmS.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"7.7","runtime":"50 min","cast":["Pankaj Tripathi","Vikrant Massey","Jackie Shroff","Mita Vashisht","Dibyendu Bhattacharya","Anupriya Goenka","Rucha Inamdar","Pankaj Saraswat"],"director":["Tigmanshu Dhulia","Vishal Furia"],"released":"2019-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tigmanshu Dhulia","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2CRk2UX3KfqMythuLBleMwQ7bQr.jpg"},{"name":"Pankaj Tripathi","character":